COMMON SHARED choose%, tlx%, tly%, size%, mtx$(), wtype%, colour%, hilite%
COMMON SHARED cityx(), cityy(), cityv(), cityp(), city$(), lname$(), filel
COMMON SHARED cash(), control(), matrix(), income(), anima(), rating(), rflag
